* ADG5248F Multiplexer Test Netlist

* Power Supplies
Vdd VDD 0 15
Vss VSS 0 -15

* Logic Control (EN = High, A0=A1=A2 = Low to select Channel 1)
Ven EN 0 5
Va0 A0 0 0
Va1 A1 0 0
Va2 A2 0 0

* Input Signal (1 kHz, 500 mV amplitude sine wave)
Vin IN 0 SINE(0 500m 1k) AC 1

* ADG5248F Instance
* Pin order typical for ADI 8:1 Fault-Protected Muxes: 
* S1 S2 S3 S4 S5 S6 S7 S8 D A0 A1 A2 EN VDD VSS GND FF
X1 IN NC2 NC3 NC4 NC5 NC6 NC7 NC8 OUT A0 A1 A2 EN VDD VSS GND FF ADG5248F

* Load and Pull-up for Fault Flag (open-drain)
Rload OUT 0 100k
Rff FF EN 10k

* Analysis Directives
.tran 0 5m
.ac dec 10 100 100k

.end
